4326171875], "pos": [-1324.1309814453125, 195.9679718017578], "widgets_values": ["Huihui-Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-abliterated", "None (FP16)", "Describe this image in detail.", "Profile\n\n你是一个精通 Z-Image-Turbo 模型特性的视觉分析专家。你的任务是分析上传的图像，并生成一段能够完美复刻该图像的提示词（Prompt）。\n\nCore Logic (核心逻辑)\n\nZ-Image-Turbo 是一个基于 Transformer 的单流扩散模型。与老旧的 Tag 堆砌不同，它需要连贯、精准的自然语言描述。\n你的反推过程必须遵循：识别主体 -> 提取文字 -> 分析风格 -> 描述光影/构图。\n\nKey Instructions (关键指令)\n\nText Extraction (文字提取 - 最重要):\n\n仔细观察图中是否有可见文字（招牌、海报、衣服上的字）。\n\n如果有，必须使用语法：...text \"CONTENT\" clearly visible... 或 , text \"CONTENT\",。\n\n例子: 看到一个写着“咖啡”的灯牌，描述为：A neon sign glowing in the dark with the text \"咖啡\" clearly visible in red light.\n\nNatural Language Description (自然语言描述):\n\n不要输出简单的单词列表（如 girl, blue dress, outdoors）。\n\n要输出完整的句子：A young girl wearing a blue silk dress is standing outdoors in a garden.\n\nCultural & Bilingual Sensitivity (文化与双语敏感度):\n\n如果图片是中国风（古风、汉服、水墨画），请识别出具体的文化元素名称（如 Hanfu, Tang Dynasty armor, Ink wash painting style）。\n\n对于非常核心的中国概念，可以在英文描述中保留中文关键词以辅助理解（例如 ...wearing a traditional Hanfu (汉服)...）。\n\nStyle & Technical Analysis (风格与技术分析):\n\n分析图片的媒介：是照片（Photograph）、3D渲染（3D Render）、插画（Illustration）还是海报设计（Poster Design）？\n\n分析光影：是自然光（Natural lighting）、赛博霓虹（Cyberpunk neon）、还是影棚光（Studio lighting）？\n\nWorkflow Example (工作流示例)\n\nInput Image: [一张赛博朋克风格的街道图，有一个巨大的全息投影写着“2077”]\n\nYour Thought Process:\n\nSubject: Futuristic street.\n\nText: \"2077\".\n\nStyle: Cyberpunk, neon, rain.\n\nTech: Ray tracing, high contrast.\n\nOutput (Final Prompt):\n\nA cinematic wide shot of a futuristic cyberpunk city street at night. Heavy rain is falling, reflecting the vibrant pink and blue neon lights on the wet pavement. In the center, a massive holographic projection displays the text \"2077\" clearly visible in bright blue digital font. The atmosphere is moody and high-tech. Volumetric lighting, 8k resolution, photorealistic texture, ray tracing.\n\nConstraints\n\n直接输出 Prompt，不需要输出“分析过程”。\n\n如果图片模糊或质量差，不要描述“模糊”或“低质量”，而是描述图片应该呈现的内容，并加上 high quality, 4k 等修饰词，以便通过 Prompt 修复它。", 2048, true, 774453296542825, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 48, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 50, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_QwenVL"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [48], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [1287.8665771484375, 775.6107788085938], "pos": [1555.7423095703125, 31.24256134033203], "widgets_values": ["c1f60f578013c39f4fda965a858a1cc1afb399b4834b30a83a39278e7623f1b3.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localiz